# The build context of control-plane, memory-service, notification-service, fleet and the
# agent runner (deploy/agent-runner/Dockerfile) is the repository root: platform-auth-sdk
# (and the core client) are path dependencies at sdk/ and services/. Everything the build
# does not need is excluded here. services/memory-service/Dockerfile.dockerignore
# overrides this file for memory-service; the console and human-harness build from their
# own directories with their own .dockerignore.
**/.git
**/.venv
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.secrets
**/*.zip
secrets/
deploy/
# git credential helpers of the agent runner image
!deploy/agent-runner/git-credential-forge-token
!deploy/agent-runner/runner-forge-credentials
tools/
guide/
cla/
.claude/
.github/
apps/
*/*/docs/
*/*/tests/
services/memory-service/*
!services/memory-service/client
services/iam-service/
services/human-harness/
